{what}

## Where it is
{where}

## How to verify it's done
{verify}

## Constraints
{constraints}

## Code economy note
{economy}

## Branch name
`feature/stylized-characters` (one atomic commit per issue, base dev; scaffold + skill already on the branch)

## Concept for learning materials
{concept}
"""

